 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask for a site",
   "texto": [
    "To stop someone: **Excusez-moi** or **Pardon**. Then: **Il y a une banque près d'ici ?** (is there a bank around here?) or **Où est la gare ?** (where is the station?).",
    "**Près** = close. **Loin** = far away. **C'est loin ?** = is it far away?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Provide indications",
   "texto": [
    "The indications are given with the **imperativo**. With «vous» is the same form of the present, without subject: **Allez tout droit** (go straight), **Tournez à gauche** (turn left), **Prenez la première rue** (take the first street).",
    "**À gauche** = left. **À droite** = right. **Tout droit** = all straight.",
    "**En face de** = opposite. Remember: **de + le = du** (in face **du** parc) and **à + le = au** (**au** cinema)."
   ]
  },
